& [RuntimeGraphProofPack: FSC3RuntimeGraphProofPackV1] is the accepted boundary pack exported by FSC3
  + [pack_id] is fsc3-runtime-graph-proof-pack-v1
  + [pack_uuid] is 963b693e-d4ba-4821-8617-313b142d8ca5
  + [source_chunk] is FSC3 runtime graph proof
  + [export_status] is accepted_boundary_input
  + [consumer_chunk] is FSC4 surface projection
  + [activation_effect] is FSC4 may be final-sliced
  + [implementation_effect] is no executable runtime graph implementation is authorized by this pack alone

  = must: treat LangGraph and checkpoint state as runtime execution state, not source authority
  = must: preserve SOP-first interrupt when ambiguity, authority conflict, stale input, missing proof, contested claim, high-risk operation, human override, or checkpoint authority confusion appears
  = must: require operator_trace evidence before future surfaces trust runtime output
  - never: let surface projection, adapter transport, or checkpoint state become signed authority by itself

