& [RuntimeGraphProofPackInvalidationRuleSet] is the staleness contract for FSC3RuntimeGraphProofPackV1
  + [invalidated_by] is change to the FSC2 planning coordination pack
  + [invalidated_by] is change to any accepted FSC3 output hash
  + [invalidated_by] is change to any FSC3-S01 through FSC3-S06 completion review
  + [invalidated_by] is discovered contradiction among graph, checkpoint, interrupt, trace proof, or fixture expectations
